 * authority (already used for its other visa categories) also plausibly
 * covers extension requests, that same authority_url is reused; where a
 * more specific, genuinely WebSearch-discovered official page exists for
 * this exact product (e.g. Turkey's own e-Visa portal FAQ on staying
 * longer, Singapore's ICA "Extend Short Stay" page, Nepal's Pokhara
 * Immigration Office tourist-visa-extension page, Sri Lanka's own ETA
 * extension-information page), that more specific URL is used instead;
 * where fee or mechanism evidence genuinely conflicts across sources
