 * the record's own content/notes rather than silently resolved by
 * guessing. A number of records intentionally carry an empty fees array
 * where no reliable extension-specific fee could be established — this
 * is treated as an acceptable, honest outcome, not a defect to paper over.
 *
 * Loaded from visa_content_db() alongside the other seed files; each entry
 * upgrades the matching bulk-generic page in place via visa_seed_page() /
 * visa_seed_page_upgrade() — it never overwrites a page that has already
 * moved past 'generic' status.
 */
