            'indian_applicant_html' => '<h4 style=\'margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Standard Extension Route</h4><p>Apply to the General Directorate of Residency before your 90-day visit visa expires, with a valid local sponsor or hotel registration.</p><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Check for Any Active Emergency Extension</h4><p>Confirm with Kuwaiti immigration or your sponsor whether any temporary automatic extension is currently in effect, since this has been a time-limited measure in the past, not a permanent policy.</p><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Overstay Risk</h4><p>As researched, overstaying may incur fines of approximately KD 2 per day and could lead to bans on future travel to Kuwait.</p><p>Our consultants can help you confirm the current status of any extension initiative before you travel.</p>',
